From: minseong <minseong7859@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 01:12:44 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 2/7] simulator: parse sm_120 traces and the OMMA opcode

Before: traces with "-binary version = 120" stop with
"unsupported binary version: 120" (and exit code 0).

- ISA_Def/blackwell_opcode.h: Blackwell_OpcodeMap = Hopper map + opcodes
  observed in sm_120 traces: OMMA -> tensor unit (SPECIALIZED_UNIT_3,
  same as HMMA/IMMA), LDCU -> OP_ULDC and CS2UR -> OP_S2UR on the
  uniform unit.
- OP_OMMA enum + AccelWattch TENSOR mapping.
- binary version 120 selects Blackwell_OpcodeMap.
- trace parser MAX_SRC 4 -> 8 (OMMA.SF has 6 sources).

No OMMA-specific operand/timing handling yet (next commit).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
